From: Dreeam <61569423+Dreeam-qwq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Jun 2024 17:43:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf and Lithium: Simplify block shape cache and axis mapping

Scan shape axes with a short-circuiting loop, reuse private enum arrays in block-state initialization, and select the existing AxisCycle table index without modulo. Preserve the shape check order and the public AxisCycle axis table.

Leaf shape scan: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/06c9c91a17e61aeed16bcfc846ebe91aa70d6c84/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0117-Remove-stream-in-BlockBehaviour-cache-blockstate.patch
Leaf cached enum arrays: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/06c9c91a17e61aeed16bcfc846ebe91aa70d6c84/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0150-Cache-blockstate-cache-array.patch
Leaf Lithium port: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/06c9c91a17e61aeed16bcfc846ebe91aa70d6c84/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0155-Lithium-fast-util.patch
Lithium axis mapping (LGPL-3.0-only): https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium/blob/mc26.3-0.26.4/common/src/main/java/net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/math/fast_util/AxisCycleDirectionMixin.java

Ported from Lophine (GPLv3 for its changes; see licenses/GPL.md):
https://github.com/LophineLabs/Lophine/blob/7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02/lophine-server/minecraft-patches/features/0150-Leaf-and-Lithium-Simplify-block-shape-cache-and-axis.patch
Lophine patch blob: ff06ea248c82af7970af51e132f4ef5f4bf628ff
https://github.com/LophineLabs/Lophine/blob/7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02/LICENSE.md

Mili port: Mili 0085 already removes the stream; retain its loop and Luminol's mutable result field, and add only array reuse and the axis mapping.

Additional pinned source references:
https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium/blob/f328cc536946a633b91788398353fbf0ac250e8b/common/src/main/java/net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/math/fast_util/AxisCycleDirectionMixin.java

